  "semantic": {
    "lines": [
      "Ah! You must be the one the master sent.",
      "It is so hard to get 'Royal Jelly' these days.",
      "I heard that you can make 'Royal Jelly' by ",
      "aging 9 drops of honey from the beehive with ",
      "the glass bottle. If you bring me that, I will ",
      "tell magic master that you have completed the ",
      "rank-up quest.",
      " ",
      "[Quest Mission]",
      "",
      "  Acquire 9 drops of honey from the 'Beedog'. ",
      "  Then age to make 'Royal Jelly' and take it ",
      "  to 'Molly the Granny'"
    ]
  },
